WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:15.780
<b>Kamio Shrine</b>

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.450
Are you really leaving?

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.710
Yes, Otomatsu-sama.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:29.550
Tahara-sensei helped 
me find this place.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:31.670
It's a shrine run by 
someone trustworthy.

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:33.830
I see...

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:36.260
It'll be lonely without you around.

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:38.140
There will be many a tear shed.

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:40.920
This is the only way.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:46.650
There's nothing else...

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:49.520
I can do.

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:08.550
<b>Silver Fox</b>

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:28.910
<b>Satoru and Haru</b>

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:37.170
Huh?!

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:41.930
Wh-What did you just say?

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:44.550
I thought I mentioned this before.

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:47.920
We'll be welcoming someone 
to our family next week.

00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:50.850
Wh-When did that happen?!

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:51.940
I didn't hear anything about it!

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:53.610
What's going on?!

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:56.320
Well, now you know.

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:59.020
That doesn't make it okay!

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:03.870
I can't believe you decided something 
so important without talking to me.

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:07.790
I refuse to call her "Mom"!

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:09.210
Huh?

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:15.250
Wh-What's so funny?

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:17.520
You've got it all wrong.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:20.300
Honestly, Makoto... 
It's not what you think.

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:21.760
Huh?

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:25.110
A child from another shrine 
will be staying with us?

00:03:25.110 --> 00:03:28.470
Yes, my former teacher 
asked me to do this.

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:33.940
I only wish there was someone 
interested in me that way.

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:36.840
From what I hear, 
we have a kendo expert

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:40.990
who will also be transferring 
to your school.

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:44.910
Yes, isn't your school 
a kendo powerhouse?

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:46.410
Kendo...

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:51.410
I think our school does 
well in tournaments.

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:56.430
That's why your school 
is a perfect match,

00:03:56.430 --> 00:03:58.460
and our shrine can provide housing.

00:03:59.360 --> 00:04:00.380
Oh...

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.970
Wait! That still doesn't make it okay!

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:04.550
Hmm? I don't see a problem.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:05.930
We have rooms that aren't being used.

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:08.640
Do you have a name?

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:10.560
Is this someone I've met before?

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:12.810
Kamio Satoru-kun.

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:16.200
A boy?!

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:21.040
Wait! You have a young 
girl living here!

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:24.000
I'm not sure I could handle living 
with a girl I don't know!

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:25.910
A boy is out of the question!

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:29.750
You're overreacting.

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:33.160
And you didn't get permission from Gin!

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:35.990
I'm sure he approves, 
since he's a herald.

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:43.090
Oh, Gintaro-sama is also a boy.

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:46.840
What? Other people can't see Gin!

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:50.080
Er, that's not my point!

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:53.570
Honestly, you're too 
relaxed about this, Dad!

00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:54.890
What?

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:07.090
Who's on duty?

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:08.130
Saeki?

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:10.270
Can you take these back?

00:05:10.270 --> 00:05:10.950
Yes.

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:17.440
<i>He's supposed to arrive today.</i>

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:18.780
<i>This sucks.</i>

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:24.910
Let me give you a hand.

00:05:24.910 --> 00:05:26.550
That's too much for 
one person to carry.

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:29.620
Uh-huh.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:31.890
<b>Reference Room</b>

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:35.130
Thanks for your help, Funabashi-san.

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:36.890
Don't worry about it. 
By the way...

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:42.270
I saw you sighing.
 Is something wrong?

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:46.460
Um, I have a little family issue.

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:47.330
Oh, dear.

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:58.130
Huh?

00:05:58.130 --> 00:05:59.290
What's wrong?

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.690
Oh, it's nothing...

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:09.230
Saeki! Funabashi!

00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:11.730
I was looking for you guys.

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:13.980
Ikegami-san...

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:16.960
We're getting a transfer 
student next week!

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:20.300
And it's a boy!

00:06:20.300 --> 00:06:21.150
Yeah...

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:23.570
What? How come you already knew?

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:26.110
I just found out from our teacher.

00:06:26.390 --> 00:06:27.240
Ah...

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:30.060
Did you use your fortune telling again?

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:31.660
N-No, I didn't.

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:36.210
So is he hot? Handsome?

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:38.180
How tall is he? How's his hair?

00:06:38.180 --> 00:06:39.820
Tell me everything!

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:39.820
Honestly...

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:41.910
Is that all you ever care about?

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:42.540
What's wrong with that?

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:44.310
It's what matters the most!

00:06:44.310 --> 00:06:48.480
Now spill it all, Saeki!

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:03.150
I'm hungry...

00:07:23.650 --> 00:07:24.750
Gintaro!

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:27.460
Is that boy here yet?!

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:45.900
I've never seen such a 
large fox spirit before.

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:49.070
You can see him?

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:52.330
Hey, there.

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:55.990
You brought another fox with you.

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:09.340
The shrine is adequate, 
but it's on the small side.

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:10.440
Haru.

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:12.170
Satoru!

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:19.430
Can't blame me...

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:23.390
Come down here for now.

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:25.010
Fine.

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:30.570
Do you live here?

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:32.040
Uh, yeah.

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:33.930
U-Um...

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:36.410
Excuse me. Where is your partner?

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:37.910
He's gone.

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:40.490
Is that so...

00:08:45.860 --> 00:08:47.090
Was that you?

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:50.750
You're adorable!

00:08:55.650 --> 00:08:58.010
Hey, girl!

00:08:58.010 --> 00:09:00.890
Don't you know how to 
show some respect?!

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:03.990
Satoru, this place is no good.

00:09:03.990 --> 00:09:09.360
This girl has the Sight yet 
she talks down to heralds!

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:13.400
And she's standing in 
the center of the path!

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:16.070
She wasn't trained properly.

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:18.310
You make a lot of noise, brat.

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:23.290
None of that stuff matters.

00:09:23.690 --> 00:09:24.750
It does!

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:25.430
Haru!

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:29.170
But...

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:32.850
Hey, Makoto! You're home...

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:38.300
You must have had a 
long trip, Satoru-kun.

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:39.800
Yes.

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:51.270
My name is Kamio Satoru.

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:53.440
Thank you for your hospitality.

00:09:53.810 --> 00:09:57.980
Oh, no need to be so formal.

00:09:57.980 --> 00:10:02.240
I'm sorry that you're stuck 
with this small room.

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:06.630
Let me know if there's 
anything you need.

00:10:06.630 --> 00:10:07.790
No need for any concern.

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:10.000
I don't plan on staying long.

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.150
Huh?

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:15.810
Please let me stay here for one week 
while I look for a place to live.

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:19.100
I can pay for food.

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:20.970
H-Hold on...

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:25.640
Your guardians already sent me money.

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:31.160
Plus, I was told that you would be 
staying here until you graduated.

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:36.430
I have the money my parents left 
me and what little I've saved up.

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:38.570
I'll get a job to if that's not enough.

00:10:38.790 --> 00:10:43.030
But you'll need an adult's 
signature to rent a place...

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:44.580
And there are other issues...

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:47.660
Makoto, talk to him.

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:51.920
Can you go away, Dad.

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:53.720
We need to talk alone.

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:54.630
Huh?

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:57.670
Hurry up.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.820
What's this?

00:10:59.820 --> 00:11:02.420
When did you get so close?

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:04.900
Then I'll let you enjoy 
each other's company...

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:06.180
Just go!

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:11.790
The chief priest here can't see heralds.

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:13.330
Neither could ours.

00:11:13.890 --> 00:11:16.510
Yep, Dad married into the family.

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:19.740
But he knows about Gin.

00:11:20.100 --> 00:11:22.570
I see. So you were the one 
who inherited the Sight.

00:11:23.110 --> 00:11:27.140
It's unusual for someone so 
young to have the Sight.

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:29.200
You're just as young as she is.

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:36.500
Satoru, it's hopeless.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:39.140
She has no idea what the Sight is for.

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:43.800
The fox here has no 
idea what he's doing.

00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:44.970
Haru!

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:50.940
So why are you looking for 
another place to stay?

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:53.850
Is it because of your herald?

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:04.280
I have a request to make.

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:08.240
Please let Haru stay here.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:27.970
<b>Silver Fox</b>

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:30.890
<b>Silver Fox</b>

00:12:31.800 --> 00:12:33.310
Please.

00:12:34.110 --> 00:12:38.940
I have the Sight, but I won't be taking 
over our shrine for various reasons.

00:12:40.260 --> 00:12:43.320
However, Haru followed me when I left.

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:47.320
Fortunately, it appears that you 
don't have a partner at the moment.

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:51.050
I promise that I will convince 
Haru to go home eventually.

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:54.290
No way! I'm never going back!

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:02.220
I don't want to live in that 
shrine if you're not there!

00:13:02.220 --> 00:13:04.750
I'm staying with you.

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:07.680
Can you please let Haru stay here?

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:12.930
Why? That fox already has 
a shrine to call home.

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:19.270
What will happen to that shrine if 
the priest with the Sight has left?

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:21.820
W-Well...

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:32.720
Well, I'm not gonna ask 
for an explanation,

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:36.460
but I don't like it.

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:48.960
A-Anyway, you should 
just live here, then.

00:13:49.270 --> 00:13:51.100
You can be with Haru-chan that way.

00:13:56.280 --> 00:14:00.020
You don't want your guardians 
to worry about you, right?

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:12.480
Gintaro!

00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:17.440
You have no idea how bad it'll 
be if I get stuck with that kid.

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:19.710
You didn't have to be so mean about it.

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.670
I'm sure they have their reasons.

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:25.300
I doubt it's anything important.

00:14:27.160 --> 00:14:29.810
Honestly, you're so heartless.

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:31.390
You're both heralds!

00:14:31.810 --> 00:14:33.580
Doesn't matter.

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:35.150
Man...

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:40.510
<i>This is getting weird.</i>

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:41.780
<i>The Kamio Shrine priest's son 
and wife died in an accident.</i>

00:15:41.780 --> 00:15:43.920
<i>The couple had a young son...</i>

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:47.810
Satoru! Satoru!

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:50.340
Grandpa.

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:54.160
Come here and we can play together.

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:55.050
Uh-huh!

00:15:57.570 --> 00:15:59.780
It must be hard for the chief priest.

00:15:59.780 --> 00:16:02.580
Yes, he's raising his 
grandson by himself.

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:08.900
Father, it's too difficult for you to 
run a shrine this big by yourself!

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:11.370
You should retire and let us handle it.

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:13.950
Quiet! Why are you 
bringing this up again?

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:15.520
That boy is my successor!

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:17.010
Father!

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:28.430
From now on, 
Satoru-kun will live with us.

00:16:28.430 --> 00:16:29.590
What?

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:31.380
That sucks.

00:16:31.850 --> 00:16:33.440
He has nowhere else to go.

00:16:33.440 --> 00:16:35.670
Your grandpa passed away.

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:43.280
Clean up this mess.

00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:01.000
Satoru-kun!

00:17:01.650 --> 00:17:03.410
Why are you still practicing?

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:07.080
Honestly, you're free to 
dedicate yourself to kendo,

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:10.490
but try not to make any trouble for us.

00:17:11.820 --> 00:17:13.680
<i>Satoru!</i>

00:17:13.680 --> 00:17:15.760
<i>You really annoy me.</i>

00:17:16.850 --> 00:17:20.170
<i>Satoru-kun! Don't do anything 
without our permission!</i>

00:17:20.170 --> 00:17:22.400
<i>We are your guardians now!</i>

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:04.920
I overslept!

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:09.200
Sorry, Satoru-kun.

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:11.470
This is my job.

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:13.000
It's okay.

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:16.670
Um, where's Dad?

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:17.910
He went out.

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:19.370
Oh...

00:18:22.890 --> 00:18:24.270
<i>Where's Gin?</i>

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:30.970
<i>Looks like he ran away.</i>

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:42.050
Satoru-kun, have you done this side?

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:44.320
It's okay. I'll take care of it.

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:46.320
I'm already imposing by being here.

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:47.850
But...

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:49.310
It's okay, really.

00:18:58.000 --> 00:18:59.740
You know...

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:03.110
I bet you don't do a proper job 
of sweeping every morning.

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:03.980
Huh?

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:07.410
That would explain why 
there are so many leaves.

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:10.840
And that big fox ran off.

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:14.960
Seriously, something is 
wrong with this shrine.

00:19:15.560 --> 00:19:17.840
<i>Just let it slide...</i>

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:19.750
<i>He's a herald...</i>

00:19:19.750 --> 00:19:22.180
<i>And it's true that I haven't 
been sweeping every day...</i>

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:23.640
S-Sorry.

00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:26.540
Haru.

00:19:29.490 --> 00:19:31.310
Why won't you go home?

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:33.320
B-Because...

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:36.780
I'm worried about you.

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:40.470
I told you that I'll be fine.

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:44.200
But...

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:48.510
Just go home.

00:19:48.510 --> 00:19:51.430
No! I don't wanna go back there!

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:53.140
U-Um...

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:55.590
I'm staying with you!

00:19:55.870 --> 00:19:56.800
Go back!

00:19:58.430 --> 00:20:00.970
I'll be fine on my own!

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:09.360
Satoru...

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:21.020
Do you not want me around?

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:24.450
Am I bothering you?

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:33.960
You are.

00:20:42.730 --> 00:20:43.880
Hold on!

00:20:44.750 --> 00:20:47.900
You need me...

00:20:48.670 --> 00:20:52.060
I need you!

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:53.020
Haru-chan?!

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:04.910
Hey! You shouldn't 
yell at a little kid!

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:09.120
Don't you need to follow Haru?!

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:11.030
Satoru-kun?!

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.480
A little kid?

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:28.510
Haru's over eighty years old.

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:33.390
Haru's been around longer than 
me and knows more than me.

00:21:34.630 --> 00:21:37.270
Haru is the herald of our shrine.

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:40.980
That's why I have to send Haru back.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:43.440
Satoru-kun...

00:21:44.080 --> 00:21:46.850
But don't you want to be...

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:50.080
with Haru?

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:51.560
Just drop it!

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:53.050
It's none of your business!

00:21:53.050 --> 00:21:53.910
But...

00:21:56.970 --> 00:21:58.130
Gintaro!

00:21:58.970 --> 00:22:02.880
Man, looks like this is 
going to be messy after all.

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:05.390
Gin, what do we do?

00:22:06.410 --> 00:22:10.300
That kid may disappear if 
you don't do something.

00:22:11.980 --> 00:22:14.810
Well, it's not my problem.

00:22:15.830 --> 00:22:19.770
Hey, you don't really 
hate him, do you?

00:22:23.990 --> 00:22:25.400
Satoru-kun!

00:24:10.050 --> 00:24:20.220
<b>Preview</b>

00:24:10.050 --> 00:24:20.220
<b>Silver Fox</b>

00:24:10.970 --> 00:24:14.200
The gate serves as
 a barrier between

00:24:14.200 --> 00:24:16.680
the sacred ground of the gods
 and the human world.

00:24:16.680 --> 00:24:19.300
Gates come in different 
forms and colors.

00:24:19.910 --> 00:24:22.100
Next time: Season of Warmth.

00:24:20.370 --> 00:25:00.000
